implementationPlan.description:
**Fix unreachable branch** (service.go:124-125): `inputTokens` is computed from `len()/4` sums, always >= 0, so `inputTokens < math.MinInt32` is unreachable. Remove the `else if` branch, simplify to:
```go
var inputTokens32 int32
if inputTokens > math.MaxInt32 {
    inputTokens32 = math.MaxInt32
} else {
    inputTokens32 = int32(inputTokens)
}
```

**Deduplicate step cancellation loops** (engine.go:362-379): The first loop (363-371) iterates `wfDef.Steps` and the second loop (372-379) iterates `run.Steps`. Both call `collectCancelableJobs` and `cancelStepRun`. Steps defined in `wfDef.Steps` are already present in `run.Steps` (or get created as new StepRun). Merge into a single loop over `run.Steps` that also handles steps from `wfDef.Steps` not yet in `run.Steps`:
```go
for stepID := range wfDef.Steps {
    if _, exists := run.Steps[stepID]; !exists {
        run.Steps[stepID] = &StepRun{StepID: stepID}
    }
}
for id, sr := range run.Steps {
    if sr == nil { continue }
    cancelJobIDs = append(cancelJobIDs, collectCancelableJobs(sr)...)
    cancelStepRun(sr, now)
    run.Steps[id] = sr
}
```
